    "The world of GSPack is full of structures from &bYUNG's Better&r mods, &bWhen Dungeons Arise&r, &bChoiceTheorem's Overhauled Village&r, &bTowns and Towers&r, &bTerralith&r, &bExplorify&r and more.",
    "",
    "Each quest in this chapter completes as soon as you &eenter&r that structure.",
    "",
    "&6Tips:&r",
    "- &bExplorer's Compass&r finds any structure for you.",
    "- Chests use &bLootr&r: every player gets their own loot from each chest.",
    "- Bring food, torches and a bed. Some of these places are very dangerous!",
  ],
